PORTABLE REPRODUCTION GUIDANCE (NOT EXECUTED FROM THIS EXTRACTED KIT)
The source processing script accepts source and output paths. The verification script accepts the parent folder containing native_floor.png and ai_upscale. These commands adapt the tested layout; compatibility on other operating systems, Python versions or architectures has not been tested. Use a fresh Python environment with NumPy and Pillow installed. From this extracted kit's root, on a compatible Linux/Python installation:
python -m pip install --target inference/runtime --no-deps ncnn==1.0.20250916
curl -fL -o official_models_bundle.zip https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN/releases/download/v0.2.5.0/realesrgan-ncnn-vulkan-20220424-ubuntu.zip
unzip official_models_bundle.zip 'models/realesrgan-x4plus-anime.*' -d inference
python inference/run_isolated.py "$PWD/native_floor.png" "$PWD/ai_upscale"
PYTHONPATH="$PWD/inference/runtime" python inference/verify_whole.py "$PWD"
If NumPy or Pillow is absent, install those dependencies in the chosen environment first. Existing matching tile outputs can be resumed; a source/config hash guards accidental cross-source reuse. Computation requires several GB of free memory per process. The output folder must be writable.

